msgid "Subdomain (recommended): Beginning with 'domain:' and the rest is a domain. When the targeting domain is exactly the value, or is a subdomain of the value, this rule takes effect. Example: rule 'domain:v2ray.com' matches 'www.v2ray.com', 'v2ray.com', but not 'xv2ray.com'."
